WEBVTT - typo3-upgrade-run (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:08.427
A TYPO3 update succeeds when nobody notices. Proving that by hand is slow.

2
00:00:13.127 --> 00:00:17.371
You ask for the update, with nothing visibly changed.

3
00:00:19.627 --> 00:00:25.256
t3u seals a 72-node graph and hands out one node at a time.

4
00:00:27.887 --> 00:00:34.587
The final proof of a real run: 360 screenshots, no undeclared difference.

5
00:00:35.637 --> 00:00:40.117
A person accepts the result. Nothing deploys to live.

6
00:00:41.717 --> 00:00:44.525
Open source. Clone the skills.
